    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaarí an axweesantá Daudi ar alhhe'eesaay. A ya/abtór Daudi, garmoó Yese, ya/abtór heé taa uráy wa qaás nee Mungú. Munguú Yakobo, Daudi guna tsawaár guri waawutmoó wa qaás. Nee inós a daausmoó wara'amtá tsuu' baraá Israeliro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umerí sleémeero ar mukduú miguuse oo bartá Daudi. Yosheb-bashebeti oo múk Takmoni, geeraharusmoó «Kudaá tám.» Inós ina slaáqw ar lawaalarós, múk tsiire dakaát guna siwár wákií tsuú/.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Heé aluudá' gaa haar a Eliasari, garmoó Dodo, oo tlahhoó Ahohi. Inós a heé wák baraá tla/ángw mukdá' tám oo dinkwa nee Daudi, qoomár múk Filisti kuwa /ooslín, qoomár niwa burumburitiyé' as slaqwara. Múk Filisti kuri ilagoów nee múk Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala Eleasari ina /aátl tawa slaqwi nee múk Filisti. Dakós iri gan'aasárií xasliít as iwa slahhaá', slám amorqae i paángarós kón. Baalaarihe, AAKOÓ MUNGÚ baalír ur gari sláy. Alaá iwa baalín, múk Israeli iri kií/ ay dír aáng Eleasari i dirii'i, as haasaánguú tawo oo múk Filisti, kudá' taa tsuú/, nguwa leehhiyé'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Migusmoó tám a Shama, garmoó Age'e, oo xoorór Harari. Xoorór Filisti tana burumburiít amór yaamaá Lehi, dír yaamaá qamaá deénguú yaariír. Múk Israeli tari goów as múk Filisti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala Shama iri /aátl sihhtanooro baraá tla/ángw qaymo as ngiwa aleekalaa/i, inós múk Filisti guri tsuú/. AAKOÓ MUNGÚ baalír ur gari sláy.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Miguuseedá' tamaawo baraá tla/ángw mukdá' urén oo mibeeraá tame, tana aweér qoomár bu'uungo, tari hardáh amór mar'ír Adulama amór Daudi. Qoomaadae slaqwaruusér Filisti xafay'ín gwaa tléhh baraá xatstá Refaimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi qoomaarihe i baraá guruú koo/ír gawit. Slawtá slaqwaruusér Filisti i baraá gixsár Betilehemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi iri oó', «Aníng ma'aá wahaangw i kángw kilá' wa slaá' bir kingi hheeki baraá hhalangwduú Betilehemu kudá' tseéw dír afkú gixsa.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukduú miguusér Daudi tamaawo tana ti'iít, tari tseegiís ar baraá tla/eeraá xafaaduú slaqwaruusér Filisti, ma'aay kiri hheék baraá hhalangwduú Betilehemu, kuduú dír afkú gixsa, kingiri huúw amór Daudi. Ala Daudi ma'aydá' gina sií' wahto. Giri yaamií ku'uús as tawa ilahhooár i haniisi dír AAKOÓ MUNGÚ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi iri oó', «Aníng a hariimaaká' ma'ayká ngiwa wah, AAKOÓ MUNGÚ. Xáy, ma'ayká' a adór tserér mukdá' slafingw'ín ngwa baraá tsaxwár uhisikáhe as ma'ayká' kiwa hheeki?»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe ma'ayká' Daudi gaa wahiiká.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adoorí an adór miguuseedá' tám aa tléhh.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abishai, hhiyoó Yoabu, garmoó Seruya, inós a geeraharusmoó miguuseedá' mibeeraá tám, inós lawaala gana ar slaáqw, múk tsiire tám guri tsuú/, kuri harafaár amór bartá miguuseedá' tám. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Xáy, kwí aa iia tleeruykáhe ak alé baraá mukdá' tam oo miguuseero? Gawaá adoorihe kuri geeraharusmooín wa qaás, ala migito adór kudá' tám gaa ayká.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Benaya, garmoó Yehoyada, oo Kabse'elír daáhh, a migusmoó slaqwara. Muruú yaariír guna tleéhh oo waa/oo/amo. Miguusér tsár gana tsuú/ ar yaamaá Moabu. Baalarka wake qoomár tsaaqwaro ina dáh baraá bohoongw, diraangw guri gaás. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Slám male alé migusmooko múk Misri guna gaás. Heewuú múk Misri i lawaalár kón, ala Benaya gár i kon a hhara kilós, guri harahi'iít, lawaalarós gari hayóh, heewuú múk Misri guri gaás ar lawaalarós ar kilá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Benaya, garmoó Yehoyada, adoorí gana tleéhh, umuuwós kuri harafaár tawa heé wák baraá miguuseedá' tame. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy Benaya tari heé iia tleér baraá tla/ángw kudaá mibeeraá tám awa miguuseero. Ala tam adoodár miguuseedá' tám ngaa aykahe. Ala Daudi guna qaás tawa geeraharusmoó úr oo mukós kuduú xuumuuseerós.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asaheli, hhiyoó Yoabu, a heé wák baraá miguuseedár mibeeraá tame. Miguusér hatlá' ar Daudi a tí: Elhanani, garmoó Dodo oo Betilehemu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nee Shama, oo múk Harodi, nee Elika, oo múk Harodi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee Helesi, oo múk Palti, nee Ira, garmoó Ikeshi, oo múk Tekoa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nee Abieseri, heé yaamaá Anatoti, nee Mebunai, heé múk Hushati, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nee Salmon, heé múk Ahohi, nee Maharai, heé múk Netofati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:29"
          },
